d data from Splunk","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?context=hla-data-input-splunk&family=yokohama&ft:locale=en-US","line":118},{"title":"Integrate with log data connectors from the Integrations Launchpad","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?context=hla-data-input-setup-integrations&family=yokohama&ft:locale=en-US","line":122},{"title":"Use Cribl and Edge Delta data inputs to streamline HLA data ingestion with tools handling large log volumes","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?context=hla-data-input-setup-manual&family=yokohama&ft:locale=en-US","line":126},{"title":"Configure log data integrations from the Integrations Launchpad","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?context=hla-data-input-setup-integrations&family=yokohama&ft:locale=en-US","line":130},{"title":"Set up an Amazon Data Firehose integration for real-time log data streaming from multiple sources","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?context=il-connector-hla-firehose&family=yokohama&ft:locale=en-US","line":134},{"title":"Facilitate Cribl log data ingestion by Health Log Analytics using the Cribl integration","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?context=il-connector-hla-cribl&family=zurich&ft:locale=en-US","line":145},{"title":"Leverage additional information available on the integration's Overview screen","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?context=il-connector-overview-tab&family=zurich&ft:locale=en-US","line":150},{"title":"Export source types to an update set by log source","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?context=hla-export-sourcetypes-by-source&family=zurich&ft:locale=en-US","line":155},{"title":"Map log data to service instances and components for alerts in context","target":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/access?context=il-connector-hla-map-business-context&family=zurich&ft:locale=en-US","line":160},{"title":"Display Integrations Launchpad from the ITOM AIOps configuration center","target":